 "title": "Rank-nullity for a finite-dimensional vector space",
 "statement": "Let $k$ be a field [def-weil-field], let $V$ and $W$ be finite-dimensional $k$-vector spaces [def-weil-finite-dimensional-subspace], and let $f:V\\to W$ be $k$-linear. Then $\\dim_k\\operatorname{Im}(f)+\\dim_k\\ker(f)=\\dim_kV$ [def-weil-vector-space-dimension].",
